# Frontend build-time configuration. Copy to .env.local for local overrides.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* variables at BUILD time, not run time — changing this
# requires a rebuild, and never put a secret in one: it ends up in the bundle
# that every visitor downloads.

# Full base path for the API, including the /api prefix.
#
# Leave unset for development and for any deployment where the frontend host
# rewrites /api/* to the backend (recommended — it keeps everything same-origin,
# so the session cookie works under SameSite=Lax and there is no CORS).
#
# Set it only when the API is genuinely on another domain:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://billsplitter-api.fly.dev/api
# and then the backend also needs SESSION_COOKIE_SAMESITE=None plus an
# APP_BASE_URL naming this site. See DEPLOYMENT.md.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
